{"4166900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drunken Hog: Dystopian Pub & Brewing Simulator", "steam_appid": 4166900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4794470], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are now the proud new owner of <i><u>Drunken Hog</u></i>! Run every aspect of your underground pub.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/e5eeb23b0a94603f9e44b3073938255d.poster.avif?t=1784279755\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/e5eeb23b0a94603f9e44b3073938255d.webm?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/e5eeb23b0a94603f9e44b3073938255d.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherited the Drunken Hog from its previous owner, who vanished without a trace. Behind the cozy cityscape, an oppressive regime pulls the strings, and the city's residents are caught somewhere between compliance and desperation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main story</strong><i> - A deep and dark narrative campaign that unfolds naturally around your bar.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue choices<i> </i></strong><i>- Meaningful dialogue choices that shape your relationships and story path.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your side</strong><i> -</i> <i>Who you serve, what you say, and where your loyalties lie will determine how your story resolves.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brew beer, serve customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/02d7f5d55cca17b6092b7ef520cc5d1c.poster.avif?t=1784279755\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/02d7f5d55cca17b6092b7ef520cc5d1c.webm?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/02d7f5d55cca17b6092b7ef520cc5d1c.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew your own beer</strong> - <i>You control every step of the brewing process. Choose your malts, hops, and yeast, then mash, ferment, and mature your beer</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock and manage your inventory</strong> - <i>Store ingredients and goods properly, keeping perishables refrigerated and supplies on the shelves for easier access</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve drinks to your customers</strong> - <i>Find fair prices for your brews and pour and serve them.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare and serve snacks alongside your drinks</strong> - <i>Heat up snacks to proper temperatures and serve other goods like cigarettes to your customers.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your equipment and expand the bar layout</strong><i> - You can buy some quality-of-life upgrades to make your job easier and expand the bar to fit more customers as your reputation grows!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your bar to make it your own<i> </i></strong><i>- Use unrestricted labeling tool and wall decorations to make the pub feel like your own!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evaluate your brews by a professional beer reviewer</strong> - <i>Call in a professional for a taste test! Your brew will be scored out of 10 to make it easier to find a correct price for the beer. You can also just keep the review papers as trophies!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smart customers with their own lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/291ac700342775d001ac47e434eeb8ae.poster.avif?t=1784279755\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/291ac700342775d001ac47e434eeb8ae.webm?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/291ac700342775d001ac47e434eeb8ae.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and randomized population for each playthrough</strong> - <i>Each playthrough will generate a pool of randomized and persistent population of characters that can visit your bar and become regulars.</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic NPCs with their own schedules and moods.</strong> -<i> All customers have own their opinion of the bar and a mood system that dictates their behavior during the visit.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attract regulars with a good service and tasty beer<i> </i></strong><i>- Best service will increase the opinion of a customer, it makes them more likely to come back and become a regular!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random events</strong> -<i> Not all visitors are there for your services, sometimes you might run in to a salesman or some other weird encounters with randomized outcomes.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation system</strong><i> - Increasing the opinion of customers will also increase the total reputation of the bar, allowing the customers to flow in masses!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Napolis City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/0956f023348a5fb9ea9dc54cb4a06df6.poster.avif?t=1784279755\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/0956f023348a5fb9ea9dc54cb4a06df6.webm?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/0956f023348a5fb9ea9dc54cb4a06df6.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely explorable open city<i> </i></strong><i>- Small part of the city is open to exploring at all times! There is more to it than just the underground bar.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enforced curfew system</strong> - It isn't wise to go out during the curfew, but sometimes you might have to...</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full day and night cycle</strong> <i>- Full 24h clock with changing skyboxes and lighting.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather system</strong> -<i> Possibility of thunderstorms, rain, extreme fog and wind to spice up the ambience and atmosphere of the outdoors.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests and events beyond the underground pub</strong> - <i>You can also trigger and find events, quests, or secrets from the outdoors, make sure to step outside once in a while!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are now the proud new owner of <i><u>Drunken Hog</u></i>! Run every aspect of your underground pub.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl