0/extras/02d7f5d55cca17b6092b7ef520cc5d1c.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew your own beer</strong> - <i>You control every step of the brewing process. Choose your malts, hops, and yeast, then mash, ferment, and mature your beer</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock and manage your inventory</strong> - <i>Store ingredients and goods properly, keeping perishables refrigerated and supplies on the shelves for easier access</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve drinks to your customers</strong> - <i>Find fair prices for your brews and pour and serve them.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare and serve snacks alongside your drinks</strong> - <i>Heat up snacks to proper temperatures and serve other goods like cigarettes to your customers.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your equipment and expand the bar layout</strong><i> - You can buy some quality-of-life upgrades to make your job easier and expand the bar to fit more customers as your reputation grows!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your bar to make it your own<i> </i></strong><i>- Use unrestricted labeling tool and wall decorations to make the pub feel like your own!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evaluate your brews by a professional beer reviewer</strong> - <i>Call in a professional for a taste test! Your brew will be scored out of 10 to make it easier to find a correct price for the beer. You can also just keep the review papers as trophies!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smart customers with their own lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/291ac700342775d001ac47e434eeb8ae.