d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/0956f023348a5fb9ea9dc54cb4a06df6.webm?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/extras/0956f023348a5fb9ea9dc54cb4a06df6.mp4?t=1784279755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely explorable open city<i> </i></strong><i>- Small part of the city is open to exploring at all times! There is more to it than just the underground bar.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enforced curfew system</strong> - It isn't wise to go out during the curfew, but sometimes you might have to...</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full day and night cycle</strong> <i>- Full 24h clock with changing skyboxes and lighting.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather system</strong> -<i> Possibility of thunderstorms, rain, extreme fog and wind to spice up the ambience and atmosphere of the outdoors.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Side quests and events beyond the underground pub</strong> - <i>You can also trigger and find events, quests, or secrets from the outdoors, make sure to step outside once in a while!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run your own pub in this atmospheric and story-rich job simulator. Featuring a full brewing pipeline, dynamic NPCs, side quests, bar upgrades and expansions, branching dialogue, a freely explorable city, and a deep narrative set in dystopian Napolis City.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/19cdc9806d327cdcf5d5087b6ea4156fc6fe2ea5/header.jpg?t=1784279755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4166900/d4c4e646bd69c61af993d536b892a337863fbc95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784279755", "capsule_imagev